    "sentence_translations": [
      "(13) Happy Birthday",
      "",
      "Qian Duoduo returned home. Nobody was there. It was already 10 o’clock in the evening. Where had they gone?",
      "",
      "“Happy birthday to you, happy birthday to you, happy birthday to Duoduo!” Qian Duoduo saw her family.",
      "",
      "In front of Uncle Xie was a birthday cake. Mom was smiling. Her little brother said, “Big sister! Happy birthday!”",
      "",
      "Qian Duoduo cried.",
      "",
      "“Child, don’t cry, don’t cry,” Mom said.",
      "",
      "“I … you guys didn’t forget …” Qian Duoduo said.",
      "",
      "“We didn’t forget! Today is your birthday. We wouldn’t forget that! But we got home late. Sorry, Duoduo,” Mom said.",
      "",
      "“You guys … you guys went to the park to play?” Qian Duoduo said.",
      "",
      "“No! We didn’t go to the park!” her little brother said.",
      "",
      "“Then where did you guys go?” Qian Duoduo asked."
